<div class="sc-fXSgRJ rVLXC __pf __pf_d_T7W6y-" id="__pf"><div data-pf-type="Body" class="sc-dExXmK cexqoG pf-1_"><div data-pf-type="Layout" class="sc-lnPyOc gujJdm pf-2_"><div data-section-id="pf-7174" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-knuQPt cVHHwo pf-3_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-kRRxPL eBhmAi"><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND pf-4_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-5_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ggpkNl jdwwxc pf-6_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dJjagV iXMvrh pf-8_">PMG Drivetrain Extended Warranty Benefit</span></h3><p class="sc-fThTNe kbMIgE pf-9_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dJjagV iXMvrh pf-11_">At <strong>Penta Motor Group</strong>, we believe in providing total peace of mind with every vehicle purchase. The <strong>PMG Drivetrain Extended Warranty Benefit</strong> is automatically <strong>activated for all new and demo passenger vehicles</strong> purchased from us and is <strong>exclusively available to the first owner</strong>.<br><br>This benefit extends the coverage of your vehicle beyond the manufacturer’s warranty, protecting you from unexpected repair costs for up to <strong>10 years</strong> or <strong>1,000,000 kilometres</strong>, whichever comes first.<br><br>This exceptional warranty is designed to ensure that you enjoy every journey without worry, knowing that your vehicle is safeguarded by our comprehensive coverage.<br><br>&nbsp;*T's &amp; C's apply</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-5393" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-knuQPt cVHHwo pf-12_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-kRRxPL eBhmAi"><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND pf-13_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-14_"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-1208" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-knuQPt cVHHwo pf-15_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-kRRxPL eBhmAi"><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND pf-16_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-17_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ggpkNl jdwwxc pf-18_ pf-heading-2-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dJjagV iXMvrh pf-20_"><strong>What Is Covered?</strong></span></h3><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND pf-21_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:20px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-22_"><p class="sc-fThTNe kbMIgE pf-23_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dJjagV iXMvrh pf-25_">Our warranty includes coverage for 9 major component categories, including:<br><br><strong>Engine:</strong>&nbsp;All internally lubricated components including the engine block (if damage is caused by a covered component), burnt valves and engine sensors. Excluded from the Engine cover are any breakdowns as a result of overheating or cambelt failure as well as cracked cylinder heads.<br><br><strong>Gearbox (Manual / Automatic):</strong>&nbsp;All internally lubricated components, ring gear, gear lever, flex-plate, gearbox / transmission casing (if damage is caused by a covered component), gear linkages, gear lever bushes, AMT unit, torque convertor, DSG unit, transaxle and transmission sensors.<br><br><strong>Turbo Assembly:</strong>&nbsp;Original Manufacturer-fitted unit only, including the actuator, impellers, shafts, the turbo electronic Control Unit (ECU), bushes and casings.<br><br><strong>Transfer Box:</strong>&nbsp;All internally lubricated components, transfer box casing (if damage is caused by a covered component), actuator and transfer box sensors.<br><br><strong>Differential:</strong> All internally lubricated components including differential casing (if damage is caused by a covered component) and differential sensors.<strong><br><br>Differential Lock:</strong>&nbsp;All internally lubricated components including the differential actuator and differential lock sensors.<br><br><strong>Drive Shafts:</strong>&nbsp;CV joints and propeller shafts, half shafts, side shafts, centre bearing and universal joints. Excluded from the Drive Shafts cover is the propeller shaft tube and balancing.<br><br><strong>Free Wheel Hubs:</strong>&nbsp;Complete Unit (Applicable to 4x4 vehicles only).<br><br>Plus, we offer specialised coverage for <strong>hybrid systems</strong>, ensuring modern vehicles&nbsp;remain fully protected.</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-26_"><p class="sc-fThTNe kbMIgE pf-27_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dJjagV iXMvrh pf-29_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Eligibilit</span><strong><span style="font-weight: bold;">y</span>&nbsp;&amp; Terms:</strong><br><br><strong>Who Qualifies?</strong> New or demo vehicles less than 6 months old and with fewer than 10,000 kilometres on the clock.<br>
<br><strong>What's Not Covered?</strong> Vehicles used for competitions, racing, or as taxis. Vehicles with voided or expired manufacturer warranties.<br><br><strong>Service Requirements:</strong>&nbsp;Vehicles must be serviced at Penta Motor Group or by prior arrangement with a PMG-approved service provider.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-b98e" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-knuQPt cVHHwo pf-30_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1555px" class="sc-kRRxPL eBhmAi"><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND pf-31_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:8;--c-lg:8"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-32_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ggpkNl jdwwxc pf-33_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dJjagV iXMvrh pf-35_">What Makes PMG's Warranty Benefit Special?</span></h3><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND pf-36_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-md:20px;--s-lg:25px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-37_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ggpkNl jdwwxc pf-38_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dJjagV iXMvrh pf-40_">Automatically Included:</span></h3><p class="sc-fThTNe kbMIgE pf-41_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dJjagV iXMvrh pf-43_">This extended warranty is added to all new and demo vehicles at no extra cost.</span></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ggpkNl jdwwxc pf-44_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dJjagV iXMvrh pf-46_">Extended Peace of Mind:</span></h3><p class="sc-fThTNe kbMIgE pf-47_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dJjagV iXMvrh pf-49_">Coverage starts after the manufacturer’s warranty expires and lasts for <strong>up to 10 years or 1,000,000 kilometres</strong>.</span></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ggpkNl jdwwxc pf-50_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dJjagV iXMvrh pf-52_">Exclusive to First Owners:</span></h3><p class="sc-fThTNe kbMIgE pf-53_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dJjagV iXMvrh pf-55_">Available only to the initial owner of the vehicle for optimal protection and resale value.</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-56_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ggpkNl jdwwxc pf-57_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dJjagV iXMvrh pf-59_">Comprehensive Component Coverage: </span></h3><p class="sc-fThTNe kbMIgE pf-60_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dJjagV iXMvrh pf-62_">9 major components, including the engine, gearbox, turbo, and more, are protected.</span></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ggpkNl jdwwxc pf-63_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dJjagV iXMvrh pf-65_">Territorial Coverage:</span></h3><p class="sc-fThTNe kbMIgE pf-66_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dJjagV iXMvrh pf-68_">Valid across <strong>South Africa, Botswana, Namibia, Lesotho, and Swaziland</strong>.</span></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ggpkNl jdwwxc pf-69_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dJjagV iXMvrh pf-71_">Simple Claims Process:</span></h3><p class="sc-fThTNe kbMIgE pf-72_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dJjagV iXMvrh pf-74_">All repairs are authorised in advance and carried out by PMG-approved service agents, ensuring smooth handling.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-75_"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-834f" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-knuQPt cVHHwo pf-76_ pf-color-sche